* Netlist for the given schematic

V1 8 0 DC Vi
R1 8 7 1/(gm + gmb)
G1 0 3 7 0 (gm + gmb)  ; Current source
R2 5 4 RD
V2 5 0 DC Vo

* Node mapping
* 8 = positive terminal of Vi
* 7 = output terminal of resistor 1/(gm + gmb)
* 3 = input of current source
* 2 = output of current source
* 5 = positive terminal of Vo
* 4 = connected node between RD and current source
* 0 = ground node

.END